<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech central bank sets o/n repo at 16.30 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech central bank sets o/n repo at 16.30 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank said on Friday it would add liquidity to the local money market through an overnight repo tender at the minimum rate of 16.30 percent, unchanged from a similar repo tender on Thursday.</p>
<p>It said it would take maximum two bids from each participant totalling at least 100 million crowns until the deadline at 10:30 a.m. (0830 GMT).</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
